<title>USA: Physicians Resource names David Real CFO.</title>
<headline>Physicians Resource names David Real CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physicians Resource Group Inc Wednesday said it named David Real senior vice president-chief financial officer, replacing Richard Owen, who was previously promoted to president.</p>
<p>Real, 43, had most recently been the chief financial officer of Renters Choice Inc.</p>
